    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>6级 游击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 野兽（鳞爪类）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 71；''重伤'' 35</span><span>''先攻'' +7</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 20，''强韧'' 19，''反射'' 18，''意志'' 16</span><span>''侦查'' +3</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6，飞行 4（笨拙）</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}爪击✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+11vs.AC<br>命中：2d6+7 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}狡猾打击✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+11vs.AC命中：2d6+7 伤害。<br>效果：该龙兽可以在该攻击之前或之后快步一格。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">次要动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">饥渴✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>前提：该龙兽必须处于重伤。<br>效果：该龙兽快步最多两格到一个接近一个重伤敌人的格子。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 隐秘+10</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 16（+6）</span><span>''敏捷'' 14（+5）</span><span>''感知'' 11（+3）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 15（+5）</span><span>''智力'' 3（-1）</span><span>''魅力'' 6（+1）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span></div></div>\n</div>",
